### Read all entries
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons

### Count and server time
GET http://localhost:3001/info

### Read one entry
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/1

### Add an entry (repeat to test duplicate rejection)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Grace Hopper",
  "number": "555-1234"
}

### Invalid entry
POST http://localhost:3001/api/persons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Missing Number"
}

### Delete an entry (repeat to check idempotency)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/persons/1

### Missing entry
GET http://localhost:3001/api/persons/not-found
